      "message": "The pattern could happen between the version of\n20200526 https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/8f3a6ca (r is from a getter which can return null)\n20211228 https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/6b104ee (restore to always use constructor)\nHowever it was fixed 2 years ago.\nSometimes the crash report may be from old version platform, which is fine to ignore.",
